WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:03,960
All are 920 pistols

2
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,160
If the caliber is to be powerful, it can only be used for self-defense.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:08,980
Each of you can use one to defend yourself. I don’t want it.

4
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:10,380
This thing is too noisy

5
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:12,860
One shot can reverse all losses for several miles.

6
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,860
Besides, when the enemy can actually get in,

7
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:15,940
The pistol is useless

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:19,320
he is right

9
00:00:19,640 --> 00:00:21,400
Hot weapons are about fighting with large teams

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,520
A team like ours hides the enemy

11
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,360
Using a gun will reveal your position

12
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,760
Then keep it for collection first

13
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:32,760
I'll send him out if I meet the right person later, Xiaoxue.

14
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,600
Just now my hands were shaking when I reached the corn kernels.

15
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,160
How do you know that ratio so clearly?

16
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,160
If you hadn't reminded me of the lessons about sugar and oil

17
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,080
I must have invalidated it

18
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:41,160
The popcorn machine has an ingredient list on the side

19
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,120
There is an exact number of lessons

20
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,240
For an experimenter

21
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,600
Do things based on data

22
00:00:45,600 --> 00:00:46,920
Just like a common meal
